  <text id="title" x="58" y="40" width="980" height="46" font="heading" size="30" color="ink" wrap="false">Parcel visibility strengthens GIS-backed land administration</text>
  <text id="subtitle" x="58" y="86" width="1092" height="30" font="body" size="16" color="muted">The platform’s real web map gives Kano a live parcel-review surface where markers, corridor overlays, and parcel intelligence support field-led administration and desk-based decision-making together.</text>
